{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/01-\uc601.png?t=1739253197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the \u201cPaw-City\u201d where a variety of animals live together!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an employee of the \u201cRailroad Corp.\u201d, you are in charge of \u2028designing railroads and connecting animal towns. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect the Paw-City with your creative strategies and designs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/02-\uc601.png?t=1739253197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Design a railroad to connect animal towns!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trains will start running along the railroad you've designed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you make it comfortable for the animal residents\u2028 to board the train?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/desc_01.gif?t=1739253197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/03-\uc601.png?t=1739253197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet a variety of animal towns and animal residents!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paw-City is home to many animals. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't panic if a new animal town comes along, \u2028just delete the railroad and redesign it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can always edit and delete to make your \u2028design more efficient!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/desc_02.gif?t=1739253197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/04-\uc601.png?t=1739253197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>As time goes on, the number of towns and residents \u2028you have to manage increases!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look at the railroads you've designed \u2028and the many animal residents who use them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep designing efficient railroads for them \u2028and grow your Paw-City!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/desc_03.gif?t=1739253197\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422460?t=1739253197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422460?t=1739253197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/d317897fc687a6e5225f74f9da75b45b5596f41b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739253197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/d317897fc687a6e5225f74f9da75b45b5596f41b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739253197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3427290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/01-\uc601.png?t=1739253197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the \u201cPaw-City\u201d where a variety of animals live together!</str